WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:16.648
Registration connects a named device to your fleet so updates
and reports reach the right machine. For a small pilot, use the
public identity generated by the installed device client. Its
private key stays on the device. Choose Devices in the sidebar.

2
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:24.165
Click Register by address. Copy the public identity from the
device client setup. Never enter its private key.

3
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.376
Click Register and approve the transaction.

4
00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:38.141
The device is registered. Registration alone does not prove it
is online. Its configured client must start and send a verified
report.

